    "objectID": "index.html",
    "href": "index.html",
    "title": "UNH Cucurbit Lab Docs",
    "section": "",
    "text": "This site holds the lab’s working documentation. For information about the UNH Cucurbit Breeding program’s research and breeding efforts please visit our lab’s main website at unhcucurbits.org\n\n\nGetting started\nNew to the lab? Accounts, access, and your first week.\n\n\nBreedbase\nHow to use the lab Breedbase instance.\n\n\nNaming conventions\nNaming conventions for lines, crosses, seedlots, traits etc.\n\n\nProtocols\nWet lab and phenotyping procedures.\n\n\nData & computing\nWhere data lives, Nextcloud, the HPC, pipelines, and cucurbitr.\n\n\nContributing\nHow to add or fix a page, and the Quarto syntax we use.\n\n\n\n\n\n Back to top"
  },
